  data: {
    LLM: "In negative rounds, 'dump' your high cards on tricks started by others where no penalties are involved. In Trumps, try to clear your short suits early to use your trumps.\n\nThe Double Strategy: If you have a terrible hand for 'No Queens' (e.g., three high Queens), DO NOT double the declarer. If you have an amazing hand for 'No Tricks', double everyoneâ€”you'll harvest their negative points.\n\nVoid Management: In 'No Barbu', if you realize you are stuck with the Kâ™¥, try to create a 'Void' in another suit so you can discard the King the moment someone else leads that suit.",
