      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Domino is the hardest contract to play well. Look for cards that 'Block' your opponents (e.g., holding the 7 of Clubs prevents anyone from starting the bottom or top half of that suit).",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Pay attention to what contracts the other players have left. If a player hasn't played 'Trumps' yet and they're low on cards, they will be dangerous.",
